"Confirming a previous note moves its portable identity and window state to the current location. Scholium does not change the Markdown file.": {
  "localizations": {
    "en": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "Confirming a previous note moves its portable identity and window state to the current location. Scholium does not change the Markdown file."
      }
    },
    "zh-Hans": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "确认原有笔记后，会将其便携身份与窗口状态关联到当前位置。Scholium 不会更改 Markdown 文件。"
      }
    }
  }
},
"Renaming preserves the note's folder, stable identity, and Metadata.": {
  "localizations": {
    "en": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "Renaming preserves the note's folder, stable identity, and Metadata."
      }
    },
    "zh-Hans": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "重命名会保留笔记的文件夹、稳定身份与元数据。"
      }
    }
  }
},
"Moving preserves the note's stable identity and Metadata.": {
  "localizations": {
    "en": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "Moving preserves the note's stable identity and Metadata."
      }
    },
    "zh-Hans": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "移动会保留笔记的稳定身份与元数据。"
      }
    }
  }
},
"Finder owns file restoration. Scholium moves only the listed source items to system Trash and retains their portable identities.": {
  "localizations": {
    "en": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "Finder owns file restoration. Scholium moves only the listed source items to system Trash and retains their portable identities."
      }
    },
    "zh-Hans": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "文件恢复由访达负责。Scholium 只将列出的源项目移入系统废纸篓，并保留其便携身份。"
      }
    }
  }
},
"Scholium will resume only the persisted forward plan. Items already moved to the macOS Trash remain under Finder control; Scholium completes the operation receipts without removing portable identities.": {
  "localizations": {
    "en": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "Scholium will resume only the persisted forward plan. Items already moved to the macOS Trash remain under Finder control; Scholium completes the operation receipts without removing portable identities."
      }
    },
    "zh-Hans": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "Scholium 只会继续已保存的执行计划。已移入 macOS 废纸篓的项目仍由访达管理；Scholium 会完成操作凭据，不删除便携身份。"
      }
    }
  }
},
"Some workspace state could not be loaded. The affected files remain unchanged; see the details for unavailable operations.": {
  "localizations": {
    "en": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "Some workspace state could not be loaded. The affected files remain unchanged; see the details for unavailable operations."
      }
    },
    "zh-Hans": {
      "stringUnit": {
        "state": "translated",
        "value": "部分工作区状态无法载入。受影响的文件保持不变；不可用操作请参阅详细信息。"
      }
    }
  }
},
