    "That note name cannot be used." : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"That note name cannot be used."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法使用这个笔记名称。"}}}},
    "The name distinguishes complete research domains. Works folders remain ordinary researcher-controlled folders, not app-managed projects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
