    "The release-bundled scholium-core-protocol folder is an ordinary Skill. You may inspect it and install it in your Agent host alongside your own method Skills." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发行版内置的 scholium-core-protocol 文件夹是一项普通技能。你可以检查它，并与自己的方法技能一起安装到智能体宿主中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The research document—not a dashboard, task board, or Agent conversation—remains the primary interface." : {
