    "These commands register the same local stdio server at user scope. Scholium copies the command only; it does not edit either host’s settings or claim setup succeeded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些命令会在用户范围内注册同一个本地 stdio 服务器。Scholium 只复制命令；不会编辑任一宿主的设置，也不会声称设置成功。"
          }
        }
